      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MOYARRA KONGK (6) slotted in just off the lead from the wide draw last start and boxed on to finish second (22.78) at Geelong in a Grade 4/5 over 400m. Well placed and gets his chance. AYESHA BALE (1) was a Bottom Up - Restricted Win winner two back then out of the placings latest at this track but moves to Box 1 this time where she has performed well. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. RAPIDO NINJA (2) is progressing well with another good run last time, placing (26.49) at Warragul. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Can feature again. LEKTRA ROSA (3) can run a bold race on best form.",
